    <title>
        Initial release: MultiDefine Anki add-on
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-12T13:14:26Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180094941?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>thegeneralist01</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/thegeneralist01</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Initial release: MultiDefine Anki add-on

Multi-language auto-define for Anki: English (Oxford), German (DWDS),
Russian (ru.Wiktionary), French (Larousse), Azerbaijani (AZLEKS).

Based on AutoDefine Oxford Learner&amp;#39;s Dictionaries by Artem Petrov.
Provider abstraction allows adding new languages with one module + one
config entry. No API keys required.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
